  "whySuccessorBetter": "The already published, independently roundtrip-reviewed capsule retains both distinct full bodies, exact logical/original mappings and surrounding provenance, raw saves/events/reviews. Its immutable content-addressed encoding is reproducible and avoids retaining another6.0MB loose allocation. It improves storage for the current opening work, not gameplay or archival semantics.",
