  "restoreProcedure": "Pin immutable capsule SHA/manifestSHA, stream MANIFEST to choose exact logical mapping, stream specified blob into an explicitly fresh destination with exclusive nofollow creation, verify full SHA/length, and preserve new restore receipts. Provided helper is source-only and unexecuted. No giant duplicate extraction or writes into original frozen packets now.",
