  "preservationScope": "ONLY VISUAL-RESULT.json and VISUAL-PROGRESS.json loose encodings. All JPEGs, checkpoints/saves, NATIVE-POINTERS, lifecycle/resource/build/caller/review/failure bodies, source/art/rights/provenance, other archives and unique inputs remain untouched. This is no broad cleanup.",
